   "object(Foo)#2 (1) {\n  [\"bar\"]=>\n  int(3)\n}\nCannot modify readonly property Foo::$bar\nobject(Foo)#2 (1) {\n  [\"bar\"]=>\n  int(3)\n}\nCannot modify readonly property Foo::$bar",
